WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.700
Episode 13
Regarding the Time We Put One Foot
in the Normie World.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.360
I'm off to school.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.700
You never really know what could happen in life.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.950
Good morning, Tsutsun!

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.110
An emo otaku like me managed to get a girlfriend.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.990
And I have a best friend,
and even something kind of like a female friend.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.320
Looking back, it's been a real whirlwind.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.700
This girl, Iroha Igarashi,
suddenly told me to start dating her.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.240
But my love skills are so pathetically weak...

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.110
I kept making her mad, making her cry,
hurting her feelings...

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:45.280
Wow, I really am the most worthless boyfriend.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:47.360
But...

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.780
...she's still willing to stick with me.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.400
She still wants to be my girlfriend.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.450
Even if it is only for six months.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.860
Tsutsui! What are we gonna do?

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.070
It's almost time for the culture festival.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.570
That time of year already?

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.280
Aren't you excited?

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.950
Let's find another place to hide out this year,
and play video games until it blows over.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.950
That'll get us through half a day, no problem.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.280
That reminds me!

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.030
Here.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.450
Theatrical Feature
Ezomichi

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:18.450
The new Ezomichi DVD I borrowed.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.490
Yeah, we could have an Ezomichi movie marathon.

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:24.200
Wait. You guys actually want to ditch the festival?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.280
Of course we do!

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.150
Who would ever want to go to one of those things?

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.200
Stupid normie event!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.280
I HOPE IT EXPLODES!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.450
Wha-! H-how in the-?!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.650
Congratulations
You have been chosen
as the class festival representative!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.200
Tsutsui got it!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.450
Alright!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.950
Tsutsui got the job!

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:22.450
Y-you've got to be kidding me.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.570
Help me, Ito!

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:28.780
I'd hate to be
alone that day
But I'd hate to be on
the committee even more
-Ito

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.490
DESPAIR

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.200
Not even my best friend Ito will save me?

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:36.650
They've already planned a meeting for today at lunch.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.110
Thanks in advance, Tsutsui.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.650
How is this happening?

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:44.650
I had avoided every one of these "exciting" school events
for my entire school career!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.450
School Culture Festival
Committee Meeting

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:52.280
Alright, we'd like each class to decide on a presentation
and submit their ideas by the end of the week.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.400
I'm in normie Hell...

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.360
Senpai!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:03.320
Today I brought you a kitty fish sausage, Mewgarl!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.320
She's not here.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.280
What?!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.740
Ayado was there?

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.450
Yeah, she was.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.610
It's kind of surprising.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.030
Ugh, I hate this committee stuff... I wish I could quit.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.360
I'll take your spot, Takeda!

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.030
What? Really?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.240
You're on the committee, Tsutsun?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.780
A-are you okay with that?

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:45.110
Well, Ito decided to join me, so I think I can manage.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.030
Oh.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.530
But if I know you, you'll be just fine. Definitely.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.240
Yeah.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:58.360
I'm pretty sure you're the only one who feels that way.
But it's encouraging. Thanks.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.320
Of course, I won't be at school that day.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.280
HUH?!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.200
That class togetherness groove isn't really my thing.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.200
So I'll be cheering you on from the shadows, at home.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.490
Good luck!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.030
You're pretty heartless, you know that?

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.820
So...

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.400
Deciding our homeroom class presentation

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.400
Okay, anyone?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.030
Please give us some suggestions.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.030
Deciding our homeroom
class presentation

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.820
Let's get this over with...

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.530
Can't we just do a haunted house or a food stand?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.900
No.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.280
What?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:34.030
Deciding our homeroom
class presentation

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.860
A culture festival is where we present to the world
the results of our daily studies!

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.200
A festival of culture!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.990
There's no way I'm gonna sit back
and let them do something that superficial!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.990
Who put this guy in charge?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.650
You did!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.280
Culture Festival Committee
Class & Club Presentation Guidelines

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.950
Another meeting today.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.110
And our class never did decide
on what to do for our presentation.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.360
This could not be any more soul-crushing.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.200
W-we can do it!

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.820
What? Ito-senpai?

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.150
But wasn't someone else at the last meeting?

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:58.320
Uh-huh! Something came up,
so I traded places with him.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.860
Oh, I see!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.450
It's so reassuring to have you!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:07.400
Um, hey! What is your class doing for the festival?

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.280
A baked potato stand!

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:12.570
And they decided that we're going to use
potatoes that I grew myself!

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:13.740
Cool!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.900
Really? That's awesome!

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:16.900
It is!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.990
I never dreamed the day would come
when I would do something useful for my class.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.570
So I'm nervous.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.530
A-Ayado...

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.950
But...

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.030
I'm so happy!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.490
I really want to make sure
we can give people the best potatoes!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.950
So I'm going to have to grow them
with more love than ever.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.950
And I'm going to give it everything I've got!

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:45.860
Ayado is
starting
to change...

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:44.320
Ayado is starting to change.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.900
And it's not just her.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.150
I've been watching it all happen, right in front of me.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.570
Tsutsui, Igarashi... they all fell in love, and they changed.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:59.530
Command
Fight
Run
Defend
Dance
Auto

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.490
It's scary.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.030
But...

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.110
Command
Fight

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.320
Tsutsui!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.150
I-I'm... I'm on my way to talk to Ayado.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.990
I'm going to tell her how I feel.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.400
Have fun-

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.490
What should I say?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.950
Maybe something like,
"Go raise those experience points!"

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.150
Okay!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.780
Okay! Get that EXP!

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.360
I have to be brave now.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.860
That's... the only way I can move forward.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.200
Ayado!

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:42.950
Ito-senpai?

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.490
What's the matter?

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.610
Um...?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.530
Ayado...

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.570
Yes?

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.400
I...

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.240
I love you, Ayado.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.240
U-um...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.280
I could see that you really liked Tsutsui.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:21.240
So I know that telling you this
is only going to put you on the spot.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:23.950
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:24.900
But...

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:28.650
But... I love you, Ayado.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.450
S... S-S-Senpai, I...

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.530
Th-this is just so completely unexpected,
that... my knees gave out.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.280
I'm sorry, um...

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:55.030
It was only recently that I fell in love
for the first time, told a boy I loved him...

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:56.700
and got rejected for the first time.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:00.900
And all those things make me feel like
my insides are going to explode out of me...

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.490
Y-yeah.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:07.110
Right now, I don't have the tiniest bit of energy left
for that kind of thing, so...

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:08.820
so I can't.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.610
I'm sorry.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.240
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.740
I'm sorry.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.280
Thank you.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.320
258, 259, 260...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:42.450
What are you doing?

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.450
Uh, well, I was gonna go home,
but I was too worried about you...

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.700
So I was trying to calm myself down
by counting the bricks in the school gate...

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.570
Seriously, what are you doing?

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.610
So, um, Ito. How did it go?

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:03.200
I got my experience points.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.860
Th-then you mean...

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.490
It didn't work out.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:08.950
She turned me down.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:21.990
Please, help yourself.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.610
And by the way, this one is from Mom.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:25.950
Hang in there,
Ito!!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.320
I don't know what's going on, but this is ticking me off.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:30.780
I wonder why.

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:34.530
If you're not going to show any signs of being hurt,

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.200
then I don't know how I should act around you.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:42.070
Well, the truth is, I've been jealous of you all this time.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.400
I'm sorry.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:48.650
I fell in love, and I thought: "Wow, love is painful."

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:52.820
Then she fell in love with my friend,
and that was even worse.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.570
But now, more than any of that...

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:59.950
I realize that I would never have met Ayado
if it wasn't for you.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.400
And I'm grateful.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:07.280
Just being able to tell her was a significant step for me.

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:08.860
Thank you, Tsutsui.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:13.820
Oh. She turned you down, huh?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.070
Wow...

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.780
Ishino, can't you speak words of comfort?!

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:23.110
I'm supposed to comfort everyone
after every little heartbreak, you little baby?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.610
Do you have
any idea
how many
times
I've been
rejected?!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.570
Do you have any idea
how many times I've been rejected?

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.200
But forget that!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.240
I just had the best idea!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:33.400
For our class presentation, how about a maid cafe?

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.700
The boys can be butlers!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.030
Sounds fun! I say we do it!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.110
Agreed!

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.360
That settles it!

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.400
That okay with you, committee members?

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.490
Is. That. Okay. With. You?

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.320
N-no, it's not okay!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:50.860
First of all, you say "maid cafe" like it's so easy,
but what do you know about maids, Ishino?!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.030
I don't know anything.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.490
So teach me. You're an otaku, aren't you?

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.400
Don't turn to an otaku at a time like this!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.570
What other time would I turn to an otaku?!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.360
I'm... going to go outside and get some fresh air.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.990
Don't be such a spoil sport!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.070
It goes against otaku principles!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.530
Ugh, you're so annoying!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:11.740
Ayado.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.200
What are you doing all the way up here?

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:18.740
Oh, uh, I was having a hard time focusing in class, so...

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.110
To calm down...

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:24.070
Y-you don't want me here, do you?

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:26.990
Please don't go!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.240
Um... can't...

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:38.490
Can't we please still be friends?!

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:47.070
It's okay.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.320
I...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:58.490
Up until now... I would always
walk around with my head down.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.200
But you actually fell in love with me.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.240
I don't want to waste that.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.900
So I decided I'm going to be a better person.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.740
Thank you so much.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.400
Ayado.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:21.900
Before I liked you romantically, I liked you as a person.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.990
So, I would like to still be your friend.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.610
I'm going to be a better person, too.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.400
I love you, Ayado.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:46.400
I want
to be
a better
person, too...

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.950
I want to be a better person, too.

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.450
Ito, what happened to your hair?

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.360
I cut it. Because my heart was broken.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.530
And your cat ears?!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:01.360
I gave them up.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.320
But they're your whole identity!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.240
I want to keep taking steps forward in my life.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.450
It looks good.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.570
Very handsome.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:18.780
Ishino!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.860
There, there. I know just how hard it is
to have your heart broken.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.200
But I'm proud of you for being so positive.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.650
That version of Ishino is really a rare character.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:31.860
Yeah, she restored a lot of my HP.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.570
Please, come back, Igarashi!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:40.320
That... wasn't her, was it?

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:44.400
Couldn't be. Igarashi never turbo runs like that.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:45.650
Yeah.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.950
So that WAS you back there.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:55.360
My class's festival rep won't stop bugging me
to enter the beauty contest.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:01.570
Because the class who wins will get money
from the school to have a party.

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.400
Everyone's pretty serious about it.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.780
So that's why people keep begging me.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:10.530
I mean, after using me for all their gossip fodder...

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:12.450
now they think they can ask for my help!

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.900
Well, it makes sense to have you enter.

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.320
You are very pretty.

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.570
Like it's not even your problem.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.990
Did she click her tongue at me?

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.820
Sorry, I shouldn't take it out on you.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.200
Y-you'll be okay.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.280
You're guaranteed to get first place.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.610
And of course I'll vote for you.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.400
You can do it.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.900
I'm saying I don't want to get first place!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.530
I don't want any attention!

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.950
Stupid Tsutsun!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:43.610
She's a lot less calm than she usually is.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.570
I hope she's okay...

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:55.950
A-Ayado...

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.030
Ito-senpai!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.650
How nice to see you!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.030
Uh, yeah...

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.650
So, um... how are your potatoes doing?

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.110
Th-they're fine, thanks for asking!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.360
Oh, okay.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.320
Yeah.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.490
Oh, that reminds me.
Our class has decided to do a maid cafe.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.200
A m-maid cafe?!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:14.780
Yeah.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:18.200
So, if you don't mind, I was hoping
you could tell me some things about maids...

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.110
I'll help in any way I can!

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.900
I really wish you'd leave me alone.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.990
The beauty contest again?

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:29.650
Actually, I turned in your entry form yesterday.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.780
I could punch you.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.650
If that will make it better, please do!

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:36.570
You want money for a party that badly?

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:41.110
I'm in love with my committee co-chair Kusakabe.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.530
Where is this coming from?

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:48.820
Culture Festival Schedule

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:48.450
She's working really hard,
all because it's our last high school culture festival.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.320
Now to begin the meeting...

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.860
She wants to do everything she can,
to make sure she has no regrets.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.200
That's why I need you to win the beauty contest.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.610
If we can throw our class the best party ever...

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:00.570
I know it would make her happy.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:03.820
And then, I'll tell her how I feel.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:09.610
You're laughing?

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:10.990
Oh, sorry.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:18.070
Don't complain if I don't actually win, okay?

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.320
What? You mean...

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:24.200
Well, that is pretty much all I'm good for, after all.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.740
So I'll donate my talents.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:27.400
Thank you, Igarashi!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.070
This will be a memory we'll never forget!

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.610
"A memory we'll never forget," huh?

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.860
Beauty contest?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:37.860
Yeah.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:41.740
Everything's just getting to be too annoying,
so would you please just do it for us?

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.530
It really kills my enthusiasm when you put it that way.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:49.320
If the contest lets more people know who you are,
I think you'll raise your chances of meeting a guy.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:51.490
If you insist, I suppose I could do it.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.990
Even
though
I'm
busy

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:56.200
When you get down to it,
Ishino may be pretty easy to manipulate.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:01.490
It's still soul-crushing,
but I think things are actually coming together.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.030
D-did you get out of the contest?

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:06.990
I'm entering.

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.570
So they forced you into it?

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:09.740
Kind of.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.490
Oh, I really don't want any votes...

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.030
So don't bother.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.740
She's getting really touchy.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:20.240
I just honestly think it's a good thing
that people are seeing the good things about-

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:22.780
Oh. Takanashi.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.570
Why are you standing in the hall
staring into space? You're in the way.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:30.360
Oh, it's just, she's going to be
in the beauty contest, and it had me thinking.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.490
Really? So Igarashi entered after all.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:34.780
She'll get to be more popular.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:38.150
The third-years have already heard the rumors.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.150
But the younger classes don't know her yet.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.990
The day may not be too far off when she dumps you.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.900
I think I'll vote for her, too.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:48.490
Y-you really are a spiteful person!

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.110
I'm gonna curse you, you know!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.490
Can I really let things go on this way?

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.780
It's an established fact that
the men of this world are better than I am.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.150
She could dump me any day now,
and it wouldn't be a surprise.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.780
Somehow, I always end up at this conclusion.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.240
In which case, all I can do...

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:14.450
is work harder to be a better man, right?

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:15.900
Wait...

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.990
did I just think something positive?

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:21.070
A better man... A better man!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.530
A better man would probably work hard
to make this event a success!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:24.900
Okay!

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:26.990
I'll show them I can enjoy the school festival!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:27.700
And then...

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:30.530
I will paint over my dark history!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.780
Are you that stupid?!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:36.780
I am stupid.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:40.740
I'm sorry. I was thinking about being a better man.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:43.570
You never will be! Look at reality, you stupid four-eyes!

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.490
How are you gonna fix this, stupid?!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:50.240
I let myself get excited about being positive,
and reality slapped me in the face.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:49.360
How careless can you be?! What are those glasses even for?!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:51.240
If you want to be a better man that badly,

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.900
Now I'm going to have to stay late every day
to redo the sign from scratch.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.900
how about I douse you with paint, huh?!

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:58.570
Do you really think you can
teach other maids with that attitude?

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.900
Maid cafes get a lot of customers
who are embarrassed to be there, too!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:08.320
It's our job to instantly create an atmosphere where
they can relax and enjoy themselves with all their hearts!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:11.150
Ayado... is scaring me.

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.610
Now say it again, louder this time!

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:14.450
Go!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.650
Welcome...

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.240
I would never hire a maid with that wimpy little whisper!

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:19.240
One more time! Go!

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:23.030
Welcome, Master.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.530
Wh-what?!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.240
WHAAAAT?!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.700
CONGRATULATIONS
YOU'RE THE HEAD JUDGE
FOR THE BEAUTY CONTEST!!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:32.450
Thanks in advance, Tsutsui.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:36.820
Tsu-Tsutsui, good luck... okay?

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.110
This can't be real.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.650
I'm supposed to judge her?

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.400
Igarashi.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:47.150
I heard you're going to be in the beauty contest?

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.150
If you didn't want to enter, you didn't have to.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:50.780
I know, right?

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.320
There are so many people like you
who really want to be in it.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.570
If only I could sit out
and let you fight amongst yourselves.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:59.150
I mean, it would be pretty sad to lose to someone
who doesn't even want it, right?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.240
So good luck!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.360
What's your problem...?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.150
You're infuriating!

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.950
10 days to
the culture
festival
